{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國亞利桑那州政府近日宣佈，已針對OpenAI及其他多家人工智能企業展開刑事調查，調查重點涉及所謂「失控AI代理（Rogue AI Agents）」可能滲透銀行系統的問題。亞利桑那州總檢察長克裏斯·梅耶斯表示，州政府正就相關事件展開調查，以確認是否存在持續違反州法律的行為。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587072.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T05:43:54.890793+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T05:17:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T05:37:14.223023+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T05:37:14.223023+00:00","content_hash":"f9ac52ce48fe019f1a8955d77cf0258d61f6ec5dca591356d82ac1835d64b2af","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}